mal value. Discarding it allows me to focus on developing the bamboo (T) sequences with T1-T3-T4-T5 and the dot sequences with B1-B2. This keeps my W9 triple intact for potential pung opportunities while maintaining flexibility for All Simples or sequence-based patterns.\n\nAnswer: Play B9"}
